  "UNIVERSAL GUIDELINES FOR MAIN AGENT": [
    "You MUST NOT apply universal transition like transition: all.",
    "Every interactive element must include data-testid attribute.",
    "Use sonner for toasts.",
    "Ensure high contrast and readability on dark surfaces."
